yle=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">)]</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 14.8pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;· </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">각 차수마다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"> 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">과목까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 14pt;\">신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">신청기간 내 반려</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\"> or </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">신청취소할 경우 신청기간내 재신청 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 14.8pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -19.7333px; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><b style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: -19.7333px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -1pt; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">▶ 1차 2과목, 2차 2과목 각각 가능함(여석없는 강좌 신청내역만 합산하며, 여석있는강좌 신청 건과 취소 건은 합산하지 않음)</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 36.4pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -36.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -19.7333px;\">&nbsp;·</span> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">학기초과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">졸업학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">복수전공 및 부전공</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">, 융합전공, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">전과생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">편입생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><u><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">폐강 및 합반강좌 수강신청학생</span></u><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 14pt;\">은 </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">차수마다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">과목까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Noto; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">신청가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -19.7333px;\">&nbsp;·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">신청경로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">수강신청 배너(대표 홈페이지 상단 확인)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">→ 수강신청(학부)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">수강변경및정정신청</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -19.7333px;\">&nbsp;·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">내역조회 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">포털(Onekit) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">→ 통합정보시스템</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">→ 학사행정 </span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; font-weight: 700;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">수업 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">→ </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt; background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\">수강변경및정정조회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -19.7333px;\">&nbsp;·</span> </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">해당강좌 담당교수 승인절차 이후 수강처리되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">, LMS</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">는 익일 동기화 처리</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0px 14.8pt; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -14.8pt;\